{
  "file_id": "3568",
  "text_count": 83,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "nd waited, but\nnobody came.",
      "_offset": 0,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "When I evolved into Plotmon, I \nstopped waiting and went on a \njourney to find them myself...",
      "_offset": 28,
      "_length": 93,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "But the one who appeared before me\nwasn't the eighth Chosen Child,\nbut Vamdemon...",
      "_offset": 122,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "And then the days of despair\nbegan, and at some point I forgot\nthat I was waiting for someone...",
      "_offset": 205,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "I-I don't understand. What's the\neighth Chosen Child?",
      "_offset": 302,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Heeeeeey! Kari!",
      "_offset": 356,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Tai!",
      "_offset": 374,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "You're...",
      "_offset": 382,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Wait! Hear us out!",
      "_offset": 392,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Kari, get away from them! These\nguys are our enemies!",
      "_offset": 411,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Get away from her, both of you!\nLlama Bebé!",
      "_offset": 467,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Stop it...",
      "_offset": 511,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Kari! Get out of the way!",
      "_offset": 522,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Tailmon!",
      "_offset": 550,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "I'm fine, Kari. That's not\nenough to hurt me.",
      "_offset": 559,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Tailmon just threw herself in\nfront of Kari...",
      "_offset": 607,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Have you recovered the memories\nyou locked away?",
      "_offset": 656,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Yes. I was waiting for the eighth\nChosen Child... I was waiting for\nKari.",
      "_offset": 705,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "So Tailmon is my Digimon!",
      "_offset": 781,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "That's right. Kari is the eighth\nChosen Child.",
      "_offset": 807,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "And I'm her Digimon...",
      "_offset": 856,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Okay, Tailmon, so even if this is\ntrue, who's that guy over there?",
      "_offset": 879,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "He's my friend.",
      "_offset": 946,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "You can't just expect me to\nbelieve that!",
      "_offset": 962,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "It doesn't matter if you believe\nme or not, but at least take the\nDigivice.",
      "_offset": 1004,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Why are you giving her Digivice to\nTai?",
      "_offset": 1080,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "It would be dangerous if Vamdemon\nfound out about Kari and\nTailmon.",
      "_offset": 1123,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "But if you have the Digivice, both\nof them will be safe.",
      "_offset": 1193,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Okay, I'll take care of this. What\nare you gonna do now?",
      "_offset": 1250,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "We need Kari's Crest. The real\none...",
      "_offset": 1307,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Real?",
      "_offset": 1347,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "The one we have is a fake.\nVamdemon has the real one.",
      "_offset": 1353,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Wait here. We'll go and bring it\nback.",
      "_offset": 1407,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Wait! Where's Vamdemon's base?\nWe'll go with you.",
      "_offset": 1446,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "You can't. It's too dangerous.",
      "_offset": 1496,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Tailmooooooon!",
      "_offset": 1527,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Kari's Crest should be hidden\naround here.",
      "_offset": 1542,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "This place is off-limits until\nLord Vamdemon returns!",
      "_offset": 1587,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "We came to switch out the guard.\nSee?",
      "_offset": 1641,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Huh? What was I doing here?",
      "_offset": 1679,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Weren't you going to switch off\nwith us and go home?",
      "_offset": 1707,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Ah, right...Okay, I'll be leaving.",
      "_offset": 1760,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Good night.",
      "_offset": 1795,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Where's the Crest? We have to\nhurry up and find it.",
      "_offset": 1807,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Don't rush things. Vamdemon won't\nreturn until dawn.",
      "_offset": 1859,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Here it is!",
      "_offset": 1912,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "No doubt about it, it's the real\nCrest.",
      "_offset": 1924,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "So what are you going to do, now\nthat you've stolen the real Crest?",
      "_offset": 1964,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "What!?",
      "_offset": 2032,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Have you allied yourselves with\nthe Chosen Children?",
      "_offset": 2039,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Those eyes of yours...I always\nknew they were like a dagger\npointed my way.",
      "_offset": 2096,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "I'll take you down!",
      "_offset": 2172,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "I'll take care of you first,\nWizarmon.",
      "_offset": 2192,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Aaaaaaaaargh!",
      "_offset": 2231,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Vamdemon, I'm the one you should\nbe fighting!",
      "_offset": 2245,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Those eyes! They're shining with\nthe light of hope, the light that\nbelieves in dreams...",
      "_offset": 2291,
      "_length": 88,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "That's right! I've made it this\nlong because I believed in that!",
      "_offset": 2380,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "If I believe in it, I can have\nhopes and dreams! And I'll defeat\nyou to make my dream come true!",
      "_offset": 2445,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "What?",
      "_offset": 2542,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "I can't take back my true self\nunless I defeat you!",
      "_offset": 2548,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Take back your true self...could\nyou possibly be the eighth\nDigimon?!",
      "_offset": 2600,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "I see! Now *that's* a completely\ndifferent story! First, I'll send\nyour precious friend to hell!",
      "_offset": 2670,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Tailmon!",
      "_offset": 2767,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Wizarmon!",
      "_offset": 2776,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Wizarmon!",
      "_offset": 2786,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Hahahaha!",
      "_offset": 2796,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "We came to help you, Tailmon!",
      "_offset": 2806,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Tai!",
      "_offset": 2836,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "What a privilege it is, to see you\ncome to me so easily.",
      "_offset": 2844,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Gaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 2901,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Greymon, evolve!",
      "_offset": 2911,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "You think I'll be beaten by such\nchild's play?",
      "_offset": 2928,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Gh!",
      "_offset": 2975,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "The fact that a Chosen Child came\nout here to help you means that \nyou really are the eighth Digimon.",
      "_offset": 2979,
      "_length": 101,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "W-what are you talking about? I'm\nnot the eighth Digimon at all.",
      "_offset": 3085,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "We'll see about that. I'll use you\nas bait to lure out the eighth\nchild.",
      "_offset": 3150,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "I may not have the Crest anymore,\nbut I'll find the eighth child\nsoon enough...",
      "_offset": 3223,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "That's cheap, Vamdemon!",
      "_offset": 3303,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Farewell for now...",
      "_offset": 3327,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Wait...",
      "_offset": 3347,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Muahahahahaha...",
      "_offset": 3355,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Tailmon... You'll come back,\nright? You'll come back...",
      "_offset": 3372,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Tailmoooooooooooon!",
      "_offset": 3428,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}